Z||000001||Mach10||11-18-2001||03:52 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fogglethorpe:<BR><B><BR>fleeting light,<BR>wretched silhouettes cast;<BR>fatal shadows,<BR>jagged reminders of glories past<P>scattered red and gold, fallen,<BR>solstice impending;<BR>splendor's untimely departure<BR>she is lamenting</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>See the trees, <BR>leaveless quiver,<BR>North wind strong, <BR>soon come winter,<P>As days grow short,<BR>And night comes quick<BR>Geese fly high,<BR>clouds are thick<P>Slipping tires and mangled bumpers<BR>the promise of snow and biting cold<BR>Of christmas trees and hanukah<BR>we mourn the sun, who seems so old<P>Of watching, looking, waiting<BR>for snow that will not come<BR>pressure rising, falling, rising<BR>the ghosts of leaves sigh "autumn" <BR> <BR>||||reg||7
